WEBVTT

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.880
"Is there anything I need to know?"

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:07.616
I held the phone and finally said,

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:10.040
"Well, you should probably know I'm gay."

00:07:11.920 --> 00:07:13.120
Silence.

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:18.376
"Hmm. I see," he nearly whispered,

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:22.136
as if he'd found a shiny penny
or a dead baby bird.

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:23.216
(Laughter)

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:26.056
"I'm glad you told me," he continued.

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.256
"You definitely didn't make
my job any easier.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.056
I mean, you are in Texas.